        "cases": []
      },
      {
        "id": "C102",
        "criterion": "派发 prompt 分【目标】【上下文】【约束】【期望输出】四段，上下文给绝对路径，约束含停止条件与 `path:行号` 引用。",
        "status": "proposed",
        "cases": []
      },
      {
        "id": "C103",
        "criterion": "派 devkit-task-keeper 的 keeper / debug-fixer-*、唤醒已派出的 agent、或对档位与 prompt 各段拿不准时，先读 agent-dispatch.md 的 SEC:dispatch。",
        "status": "proposed",
        "cases": []
      },
      {
